      "sha256": "5e3c6eb3fe35891e27f6bd4bb5c71aabce33acc41d97e5b4ccbb92e22eb28848",
      "actualHeroExcerpt": "Regular exercise and a healthy diet are the secret to staying fit.\n\n規律運動和健康飲食是保持健康的祕訣。",
      "pixelsActuallyViewed": true
    },
    {
